  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/10/IMG_5201.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">Com cada primer diumenge de mes, s&#39;ha celebrat una nova edici&oacute; de Suera Obert Museu (SOM), organitzada pel Centre Cultural i dedicada en aquesta ocasi&oacute; a la matan&ccedil;a del porc. S&#39;ha complementat amb les parades de Comerciants de Sueras, tamb&eacute; a la pla&ccedil;a.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommatancaporc14/img_5200.jpg\" alt=\"img_5200\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommatancaporc14/img_5201.jpg\" alt=\"img_5201\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommatancaporc14/img_5202.jpg\" alt=\"img_5202\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommatancaporc14/img_5203.jpg\" alt=\"img_5203\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommatancaporc14/img_5204.jpg\" alt=\"img_5204\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommatancaporc14/img_5205.jpg\" alt=\"img_5205\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommatancaporc14/img_5207.jpg\" alt=\"img_5207\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommatancaporc14/img_5208.jpg\" alt=\"img_5208\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommatancaporc14/img_5210.jpg\" alt=\"img_5210\" styl